# Practical 11: Timing Template

## Command

```bash
sudo nmap -T4 -sS -p 1-200 192.168.1.10
```

### Flag Explanation

| Flag | Meaning |
|--------|----------|
| -T4 | Faster Scan Speed |
| -sS | SYN Scan |
| -p | Port Range |

### Timing Levels

| Level | Description |
|---------|-------------|
| T0 | Paranoid |
| T1 | Sneaky |
| T2 | Polite |
| T3 | Normal |
| T4 | Fast |
| T5 | Insane |

### Output Shows

Same scan results but faster.

